				1929,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Consolidate Layer composition and optimize IPC payload handling\n\nReplace the verbose chain of `Layer.provideMerge` calls with a single `Layer.mergeAll` invocation to reduce intermediate composition objects from O(n) to O(1) and improve readability. Standardize build configurations to conditionally enable debug logging and metafiles based on the environment, while stripping `console` statements in production builds.\n\nRefactor `TauriIPC` to streamline argument serialization, passing arguments directly to the `MountainIPCInvoke` command instead of manual array wrapping, and remove the unused `removeAllListeners` stub. Align `Preload.ts` argument handling with the service layer for consistent IPC semantics.",
			"SHA": "ac80d96cc33b8edf81463873fb464f83bc8f69d0"
		}
